{
  "id": "densities_of_aqueous_solutions_of_inorganic_chlori",
  "title": "Densities of Aqueous Solutions of Inorganic Chlorides",
  "description": "Calculate densities and concentration conversions for aqueous solutions of inorganic chlorides at 20°C. Supports conversion between mass%, mol/kg (molality), and mol/liter (molarity) for various chloride compounds including Ammonium, Barium, Calcium, Cesium, Hydrogen chloride, Iron(III), Lithium, Magnesium, Potassium, Sodium, and Strontium chlorides.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Density Calculator for Aqueous Inorganic Chloride Solutions\n\nThis calculator provides density and concentration data for aqueous solutions of inorganic chlorides at 20°C.\n\n**Concentration Units:**\n- **wt% (Mass%):** Mass of solute / total mass of solution × 100%\n- **mol/kg (Molality):** Moles of solute / kg of water\n- **mol/liter (Molarity):** Moles of solute / liter of solution\n\nSelect a chloride compound and concentration to retrieve density and converted concentration values."
    },
